cookies.text:
This website uses no advertising or audience measurement cookies. It only stores essential technical information in your browser:
• cda_age (cookie and local storage, 1 year): your answer to the age check;
• NEXT_LOCALE (cookie, for the visit): the chosen language;
• cda_nl_bar (local storage): the news banner you closed.

